DESCRIPTION:In answer to No Kings national call\, we will join together to
  reaffirm our support for voting rights and an inclusive\, democratic Amer
 ica and to oppose Trump extremism. Join us in watching the “Rise Up\, Si
 ng Out Concert for the First Amendment\,” hosted by Jane Fonda and the C
 ommittee for the First Amendment in New York City. As Trump watches cage f
 ighting at our White House\, we will continue to fight his corrupt and dis
 astrous mismanagement of our country! This is the perfect time to join wit
 h o
LOCATION:West Sacramento\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/964431/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
